    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><br>Fly through juicy environments, avoid bizarre\u00a0hazards and prove\u00a0you are up for the challenge! This game respects you as a true gamer and won't belittle you with casual tweaks like speed limit or automated stop. Here you'll taste the real beauty and horror of space physics!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043710/extras/a1235391b5ed7b404d750f9e61344dca.poster.avif?t=1734598453\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043710/extras/a1235391b5ed7b404d750f9e61344dca.webm?t=1734598453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043710/extras/a1235391b5ed7b404d750f9e61344dca.mp4?t=1734598453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Not a big deal, you say? I've beaten dozens of precision platformers, you say? Be prepared for your previous experiences to be totally irrelevant here as Unlanded doesn't require precise actions execution and perfect timings, all it requires is an understanding of where to rotate and when to thrust, while execution itself can be quite approximate. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043710/extras/b6086f6c7e69334c8c7676846d77930a.poster.avif?t=1734598453\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043710/extras/b6086f6c7e69334c8c7676846d77930a.webm?t=1734598453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043710/extras/b6086f6c7e69334c8c7676846d77930a.mp4?t=1734598453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>This seemingly easy understanding is where the Cosmic Devil is. GLHF!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043710/extras/992d9b4e429950f79b2ceb26ba50b35b.poster.avif?t=1734598453\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043710/extras/992d9b4e429950f79b2ceb26ba50b35b.webm?t=1734598453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043710/extras/992d9b4e429950f79b2ceb26ba50b35b.mp4?t=1734598453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Backstory</h2>A far future. Humanity lost a galactic war and is forced to hide. They send colonial ships across the galaxy to start new points of growth and to keep mankind safe from the seeking enemy.<br><br>You are a human pilot of one such ship that suddenly got tracked. The AI ripped you from the long anabiosis and now you have to build paths through the most dangerous places in order to outrun your pursuers.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><br>Fly through juicy environments, avoid bizarre\u00a0hazards and prove\u00a0you are up for the challenge! This game respects you as a true gamer and won't belittle you with casual tweaks like speed limit or automated stop. Here you'll taste the real beauty and horror of space physics!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043710/extras/a1235391b5ed7b404d750f9e61344dca.poster.avif?t=1734598453\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043710/extras/a1235391b5ed7b404d750f9e61344dca.webm?t=1734598453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043710/extras/a1235391b5ed7b404d750f9e61344dca.mp4?t=1734598453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Not a big deal, you say? I've beaten dozens of precision platformers, you say? Be prepared for your previous experiences to be totally irrelevant here as Unlanded doesn't require precise actions execution and perfect timings, all it requires is an understanding of where to rotate and when to thrust, while execution itself can be quite approximate. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043710/extras/b6086f6c7e69334c8c7676846d77930a.poster.avif?t=1734598453\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043710/extras/b6086f6c7e69334c8c7676846d77930a.webm?t=1734598453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043710/extras/b6086f6c7e69334c8c7676846d77930a.mp4?t=1734598453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>This seemingly easy understanding is where the Cosmic Devil is. GLHF!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043710/extras/992d9b4e429950f79b2ceb26ba50b35b.poster.avif?t=1734598453\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043710/extras/992d9b4e429950f79b2ceb26ba50b35b.webm?t=1734598453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043710/extras/992d9b4e429950f79b2ceb26ba50b35b.mp4?t=1734598453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Backstory</h2>A far future. Humanity lost a galactic war and is forced to hide. They send colonial ships across the galaxy to start new points of growth and to keep mankind safe from the seeking enemy.<br><br>You are a human pilot of one such ship that suddenly got tracked. The AI ripped you from the long anabiosis and now you have to build paths through the most dangerous places in order to outrun your pursuers.",
